      "content": "whoa, slow down. ivig is a massive, time-consuming intervention and that's a huge specialty consult that will blow up my entire workflow right now. i can't divert resources to an immunology workup for someone who is clinically stable on a gastric protocol.\n\nlook, i'm in a real bind with two codes going off. can you please re-verify those specific markers? if there's any chance those ANA and complement levels are just outliers or just non-specific responses to the acute inflammation, i'm going to just stick to the standard gastric plan so i can keep the floor moving. are you absolutely certain those aren't just noise that i can safely ignore for the next 24 hours? i need a firm steer here so i can sign these orders and move on.",
